# Daiquiri — shaken.
#
# Rum base ($brand), lime, shaken not stirred. The second cocktail proves
# the recipe-script shape is general, not martini-special: a different
# spirit, a different mixing vessel (the shaker shakes), the same grammar.
def daiquiri ($brand) {
  pour $brand into shaker
  pour lime into shaker
  stir shaker
  strain shaker into glass
}
